WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.300
We are hanging out
with Tracy Morgan.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.634
Now look at these dates
are here.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:07.567
Go see Tracy live
doing some stand-up.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.334
Tracy, you are not afraid
to speak your mind

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.400
and you always have a strong
point of view on things,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.901
so I thought right now you could
help some people out there

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.300
with big life decisions.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.434
It's time for "Life Coach
with Tracy Morgan."

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.133
Here we go.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:24.601
-♪ Life Coach
with Tracy Morgan ♪

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.400
-Alright. You're gonna
get some tough advice.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.067
-Okay.
-Right? Here you go.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.000
How about this one?

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:40.200
-Say, "Well, me and you
going as Jada and Tupac.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:43.767
You Jada. I'm Tupac.
Don't worry about it.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.534
Will don't mind."

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:47.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:54.334
-Oh, man, you didn't read the --
Did you read that book?

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.300
-Yeah, I read the book, man.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.200
What's it called?
What's the name of the book?

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.667
-"Worthy," I think.
-"Worthy"?

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.300
It should be called "Let's Kick
Will Smith in the Nuts."

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.801
-Okay. Alright.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:07.300
Alright. This one...

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.434
-First off, I don't even care
about his feelings.

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:24.367
You ain't coming in my house.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.400
Until I get my money back.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.000
-That's right! This is --
How about this one?

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:41.100
-Well, me and my mother
haven't spoken for three years

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.801
over potato salad.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:47.100
You don't put no raisins in
a Black person's potato salad.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:52.200
So that goes to tell you.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:56.601
-I totally agree, by the way.
No raisins. No, no.

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.334
How about this?

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.267
-Well, give your real fa--
Give me a call.

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:11.667
Let's talk it over.
I'm your real daddy.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.033
Give me a call.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.868
-It's gonna confuse them.
Alright.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.634
-I don't care
if you're confused.

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:21.167
I'll give you some of that
SSI check, though.

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:22.601
SSI.

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:24.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:28.300
-What's that?
I don't know that one.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.767
Do I know SSI?

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:31.834
-SSI. Social Security.

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:33.634
-Oh.

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:37.334
Oh, yeah. Social Security. SSI.

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:39.901
Who's your --
Who's your biological father?

00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.501
-Who's my biological father?
David --

00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:44.200
Everybody knows. David Ruffin.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.067
From the Temptations.
David Ruffin.

00:02:46.067 --> 00:02:47.234
-Yeah, of course.

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.367
-David Ruffin
is my biological daddy!

00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:51.667
-I didn't want anyone knowing.
I know it's...

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:54.133
-David Ruffin.
-David Lee Roth.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:56.601
-Who? David Lee Roth?
I don't know no David Lee Roth.

00:02:56.601 --> 00:02:58.467
I know David Lee Ruffin.

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:00.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:02.968
David Ruffin is my daddy.
All of them jealous.

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:05.133
We thought it was Sam Cooke,
but it's David Ruffin.

00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:06.567
-Yeah.

00:03:06.567 --> 00:03:08.734
-You know, my grandmother be
getting my grandfather upset.

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.701
She said she had something
going on with Sam Cooke.

00:03:10.701 --> 00:03:13.767
I said, "Grandpa, she ain't
even know who Sam Cooke was!"

00:03:13.767 --> 00:03:15.634
-And who were you talking --
What was your grandpa's name?

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:16.667
-My grandfather?
-Yeah.

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:18.300
-My grandfather?
-Yes.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.934
-Red Foxx.

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:26.067
-This question says...

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:27.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:36.100
-Pee on his shoe.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.767 --> 00:03:41.634
-Tracy Morgan knows.
Hopefully that helped.

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:43.634
Tracy Morgan, everybody!

